; Simplified illustration of pipelined stages (not actual Y86-64)
; Stage 1: Instruction Fetch (IF)
IF:  Instruction = Mem[PC]; PC = PC + 4;
; Stage 2: Instruction Decode (ID)
ID: Decode Instruction; Read Registers;
; Stage 3: Execute (EX)
EX: Perform ALU operation;
; Stage 4: Memory Access (MEM)
MEM: Access memory if needed;
; Stage 5: Write Back (WB)
WB: Write result back to register file;
